# Models bind in DataInstaller

All models are bound as `AsSingle()` only in `DataInstaller` (ProjectContext). Do not bind models in scene or module installers.

```csharp
// BAD — module/scene installer
Container.Bind<ConnectionSessionModel>().AsSingle();

// GOOD — DataInstaller
Container.Bind<ConnectionSessionModel>().AsSingle();
```

Services, use cases, and facades stay in their module installers (for example `ConnectionModuleInstaller` in Global). A MonoBehaviour may register itself into a model; it must not bind the model.
